<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4979" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάρυγμα</span></b> , 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμαρτώλ-υχμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sparkle, twinkle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. λάμπρον προσώπω</span>”
				<i>flashing, radiant glance,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					5.18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.288
			</span></i>; of changing colour, and light, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.258
			</span></i> (Paul. Sil.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδύμης ἀ.
			χροιῆς,</span> of gems, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				71
			</span></i>, etc.; of any quick, light motion, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χαρίτων ἀμαρύγματ᾽ ἔχουσα</span> with <i>the flashing
				steps</i> of Graces, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				94
			</span></i>; of wrestling, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πάλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					8.36
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. χείλεος</span>
			<i>quivering</i> of the lip, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				23.7
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πισύρων ἀρετῶν ἀμαρύγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.343
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
